  "name": "rustdoc-md",
  "description": "A specialized utility and library for synthesizing structured Markdown documentation from the unstable rustdoc JSON output format. It performs recursive traversal of the rustdoc_types::Crate index to faithfully represent module hierarchies, trait implementations, and complex function signatures while ensuring high readability. The implementation supports both local JSON artifact processing and automated retrieval of zstd-compressed documentation from docs.rs for arbitrary targets.",
